      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "東雲、来てたんだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_c:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。今日の感謝祭の打ち合わせに、\n焼き菓子を持って行こうかと。神谷は？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_c:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺もブレンドティーを持って行こうと思って、\nここに寄ったんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_c:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "会えてよかったかもしれませんね。\nあなた、まだ事務所への道に慣れていないでしょう？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_c:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この間も迷子になっていましたし……。\nお菓子が焼きあがったら、一緒に行きましょうか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_06_c:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_06_c",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_06_c.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "悪いな、よろしく頼む。\n俺も準備が終わったら、声をかけるよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
